  "description": "The Cipher is designed for young riders looking to transition from a BMX bike to a multi-speed bike with larger wheels. Equipped with aluminum rigid fork, simple gearing, and comfortable larger tires, the Cipher offers kids a lightweight, versatile bike for effortless, fun-filled everyday riding. Available in in 20” and 24” models.\nMongoose Tectonic T1 aluminum frame and aluminum rigid fork.\n7-speed rear derailleur with a twist shifter perfect for young riders.\nKenda 24x1.75\" tires on Xposure single-wall aluminum rims, and Mongoose alloy v-brakes.\nDesigned for young riders looking to transition to a multi-speed bike with larger wheels. Suggested rider height is 4’8” to 5’6” tall.",
